RevisionGraph.swift adapts CRevisionGraphWnd::FetchRevisionData's ordered
child-map reduction, revision scopes and excluded-parent nodes, together with
CGit::GetSubmodulePointer's superproject-index retention and conflict-side
labels, including CTGitPath::IsRebaseActive's rebase wording (native Git also
recognizes rebase-merge directories). Revision graph
source: copyright (C) 2003-2011 TortoiseSVN; 2012-2023, 2025-2026 TortoiseGit,
under GPL version 2 or later. See docs/REVISION-GRAPH-PARITY.md for the source
pin and outstanding native layout, window, menu and export work.

GraphLayout statically embeds the OGDF source selected by TortoiseGit's gitlink
17f045b131851f5d32af184d5a7a864cec2bfc27, including its COIN solver sources.
OGDF offers GPL version 2 or 3 with stated exceptions for COIN and its required
libraries; this project uses GPL version 2. The original OGDF license/GPL texts,
the EPL 1.0 text for COIN, exact corresponding source archive and reconstruction
scripts are included under Contents/Helpers/GraphLayout. Original contributor
copyright and third-party notices are retained in that archive. The adapter's
Sugiyama configuration and Swift border clipping adapt CRevisionGraphWnd's
layout constructor and cutPoint/DrawConnections (TortoiseSVN/TortoiseGit,
GPL version 2 or later). See docs/GRAPH-LAYOUT-RUNTIME.md.

Command and status icon artwork is copied unchanged from TortoiseGit resources.
Those icons were derived from the TortoiseSVN project: https://tortoisesvn.net/
The upstream notice also names https://tortoisesvn.tigris.org/ (historical site).
We use the GNU GPL alternative offered by the upstream resource license.
The original resource license, source paths and SHA-256 hashes are retained in
Sources/TurtleGitCore/Resources/Icons/ and bundled with the shared framework.
Copyright (c) 2006-2007 The TortoiseSVN Project. All rights reserved.

AppStore preparation bundles a pinned Git engine built from its unmodified
upstream source archive (https://www.kernel.org/pub/software/scm/git/). Git is
licensed under GPL v2. Its corresponding source archive, COPYING, retained
third-party notices and reconstruction scripts are included under
Contents/Helpers/Git/share/licenses/git/. Configuration/GitRuntime.json records
the version, source URL and checksum. macOS system libraries are not redistributed.

All Xcode configurations now bundle pinned OpenSSH clients/agent tools with
statically linked OpenSSL. OpenSSH retains its BSD and other permissive notices;
OpenSSL retains Apache License 2.0. Original license texts, complete publisher
source archives, pin configuration and reconstruction/audit scripts are retained
under Contents/Helpers/OpenSSH/. Configuration/OpenSSHRuntime.json records the
versions and archive checksums. These are separate helper executables; no OpenSSL
code is linked into the Swift application or Git engine. Signed sandbox invocation
and full authentication parity remain unverified.

The app bundles EditorConfig C Core and statically linked PCRE2. Their original
license texts, pinned source/test archives and reconstruction script are retained
under Contents/Helpers/EditorConfig/. Configuration/EditorConfigRuntime.json
records source versions and checksums. EditorConfig includes Simplified/New/
Revised BSD and per-file notices; PCRE2 retains its BSD license and exceptions.
Consult the included license texts and complete corresponding sources.

